The system optimizes for both memory usage and performance across varying data rates by dynamically managing the collection of frames and utilizing efficient algorithms where possible. The trade-off between immediate memory efficiency and ease of future enhancements is addressed through a balance of using optimized data structures while maintaining flexibility in the design for potential modifications.']

