The `create_crc_indication_pdu()` function dynamically generates and manages `NFAPI_CRC_INDICATION_PDU_T` structures using the RNTI pool. It ensures that no two structures share the same RNTI by first attempting to retrieve an available RNTI from the pool and generating a new one if necessary. The implementation is designed to be easily extensible, as additional structure fields can be added without significant refactoring.']

