The code provides an `init_list()` function to initialize the valid range flags, which are used by the `is_tag_and_rnti_valid()` function to validate whether the provided RX_UE_INFORMATION_TAG and RNTI are within valid ranges before inclusion in the list.

The logging mechanism records the number of times the list has reached its maximum capacity and was resized, ensuring accurate performance monitoring over extended usage periods.']

